          <h4 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0e5b4d; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px;">Subscriber Details / \u06AF\u0627\u06C1\u06A9 \u06A9\u06CC \u062A\u0641\u0635\u06CC\u0644\u0627\u062A</h4>
